  "text": "A new housing development site has had three accidents in one month: a worker slipped on a wet walkway, a delivery driver struck a worker near the site entrance, and a labourer sustained a back injury lifting heavy blocks.\n\nEvaluate how effective risk assessments and the correct hierarchy of control could have prevented these accidents.",
